<title>UK: Goldman Sachs set calls on dollar sensitive basket.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs set calls on dollar sensitive basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.Wertpapier GmbH has issued 10 million American-style call warrants, on a dollar sensitive basket of companies, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co. oHG said.</p>
<p>The basket comprised of 13 equally weighted companies which includes shares of Pechiney SA &quot;A&quot;, Salomon SA, L'Air Liquide SA, Societe Technip, Michelin SA &quot;B&quot;, Koninklijke Ahold NV, Philips Electronics NV, Mo Och Domsjo AB &quot;B&quot;, Svedala Industri AB, Daimler Benz, Siemens AG, Zurich Insurance Co and Electrolux AB &quot;B&quot;.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1000 DEM		  PREMIUM	10.40 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.04 DEM		  GEARING	9.62 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 24.FEB.97-07.AUG.98   PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FFURT, STUTT    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1000 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
